WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
One customer journey.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Make the workspace yours.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Keep the relationship in view.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Give every deal a next step.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Make time for the conversation.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Follow up in the right channel.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:13.000
Build sending volume gradually.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:39.000
From opportunity to paperwork.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:03:07.000
Make the next action repeatable.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:24.000
Shape the workspace around the team.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:43.000
Give the right people access.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:04:06.000
Operate across workspaces.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:20.000
One workspace for what follows.
